  id: spell-prayer-of-healing
  displayName: Prayer of Healing
  description: Up to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range each regain hit points equal to 2d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier (fixed at +3 for this sample). No effect on undead or constructs. Casting time is 10 minutes, which has no matching action-economy resource here (only Action/Bonus Action/Reaction exist), so this ability only costs the spell slot. When cast using a higher-level slot, healing increases by 1d8 per slot level above 2nd.
